    "text": "57 minutes ago GATLINBURG, Tenn — Dorothy Johnson lives in Gatlinburg and says Wednesday was a dream come true. That's because she celebrated the blessing of a new Safe Haven Baby Box. \"I was given up at nine months old for adoption and I thought if we'd had a baby box, my mom would have probably stuffed me in it,\" Johnson said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
